<v Lina Misitzis>Here's what Lana's daughter does know. She knows her mom has a, quote, "grown up job," which is why she has a lot of fun clothes and high heels, which she likes to try on. She knows her mom takes pictures for people and makes videos for them. And she knows that, sometimes, people like to buy her mom's clothes after she's worn them. And that's what she knows. For now, she isn't asking for more. And Lana's waiting for her to ask.
<v Lina Misitzis>这是拉娜女儿所知道的。她知道她妈妈有一份所谓的“成年人的工作”，这就是为什么她有很多有趣的衣服和高跟鞋，她喜欢试穿。她知道她妈妈为人们拍照片并为他们制作视频。她知道有时人们喜欢买她妈妈穿过的衣服。这就是她所知道的。目前，她没有询问更多。而拉娜在等待她询问。

00:51:23.050 --> 00:51:40.000
<v Lina Misitzis>And her son, he was six when we talked. He didn't know anything about his mom's work yet. He didn't even know it was a door he could knock on. Knocking on doors, by the way, a lesson he should probably learn sooner than later. One time, Lana told me, she snuck off for a quick cam show.
